[patterns/information/api-microservices/PTN-INF-API-001-data-consistency-pattern.md#phase-1-implement-asynchronous-messaging-infrastructure-2-4-weeks]

#### Phase 1: Implement Asynchronous Messaging Infrastructure (2-4 weeks)

**Goal**: Establish reliable messaging foundation for service communication.

**Steps**:

**Step 1.1: Deploy Message Broker**

```bash
# Deploy Azure Service Bus namespace (Premium tier for guaranteed throughput)
az servicebus namespace create \

  --resource-group gainwell-prod \
  --name gainwell-events-prod \
  --location eastus2 \
  --sku Premium \
  --capacity 1

# Create topics for domain events
az servicebus topic create \

  --resource-group gainwell-prod \
  --namespace-name gainwell-events-prod \
  --name member-events \
  --enable-partitioning true \
  --max-size 5120

az servicebus topic create \

  --resource-group gainwell-prod \
  --namespace-name gainwell-events-prod \
  --name claims-events \
  --enable-partitioning true \
  --max-size 5120

# Create subscriptions for consuming services
az servicebus topic subscription create \

  --resource-group gainwell-prod \
  --namespace-name gainwell-events-prod \
  --topic-name member-events \
  --name claims-service-subscription \
  --max-delivery-count 5 \
  --lock-duration PT5M

# Create dead letter queues
az servicebus queue create \

  --resource-group gainwell-prod \
  --namespace-name gainwell-events-prod \
  --name member-events-dlq \
  --enable-dead-lettering-on-message-expiration true
```

**Step 1.2: Implement Event Publishing**

```csharp
// Member Service: Publish domain events
public class MemberService {
    private readonly IServiceBusSender _eventPublisher;
    private readonly IMemberRepository _repository;

    public async Task EnrollMemberAsync(MemberEnrollmentRequest request) {
        // Local transaction: persist member to database
        var member = new Member {
            Id = Guid.NewGuid(),
            FirstName = request.FirstName,
            LastName = request.LastName,
            DateOfBirth = request.DateOfBirth,
            EnrollmentDate = DateTime.UtcNow
        };

        await _repository.InsertAsync(member);

        // Publish domain event
        var domainEvent = new MemberEnrolledEvent {
            EventId = Guid.NewGuid(),
            EventType = "member.enrolled",
            EventVersion = "1.0",
            Timestamp = DateTime.UtcNow,
            CorrelationId = Activity.Current?.Id ?? Guid.NewGuid().ToString(),
            Data = new {
                MemberId = member.Id,
                FirstName = member.FirstName,
                LastName = member.LastName,
                EnrollmentDate = member.EnrollmentDate
            }
        };

        var message = new ServiceBusMessage(JsonSerializer.Serialize(domainEvent)) {
            MessageId = domainEvent.EventId.ToString(),
            CorrelationId = domainEvent.CorrelationId,
            ContentType = "application/json",
            Subject = "member.enrolled"
        };

        await _eventPublisher.SendMessageAsync(message);

        _logger.LogInformation(
            "Published member.enrolled event: {EventId}, MemberId: {MemberId}, CorrelationId: {CorrelationId}",
            domainEvent.EventId, member.Id, domainEvent.CorrelationId
        );
    }
}
```

**Step 1.3: Implement Event Subscription**

```javascript
// Claims Service: Subscribe to member.enrolled events
const serviceBusClient = new ServiceBusClient(connectionString);
const receiver = serviceBusClient.createReceiver(
    'member-events',
    'claims-service-subscription'
);

// Message handler
receiver.subscribe({
    processMessage: async (message) => {
        const correlationId = message.correlationId;
        console.log(`Processing message: ${message.messageId}, Correlation: ${correlationId}`);

        try {
            const event = JSON.parse(message.body.toString());

            // Update local member cache for eligibility checks
            await memberCache.upsert({
                memberId: event.data.memberId,
                firstName: event.data.firstName,
                lastName: event.data.lastName,
                eligible: true,
                effectiveDate: event.data.enrollmentDate
            });

            console.log(`Successfully processed member.enrolled: ${event.data.memberId}`);

            // Acknowledge message (removes from queue)
            await receiver.completeMessage(message);

        } catch (error) {
            console.error(`Error processing message: ${error}`);

            // Reject message; will be redelivered or moved to DLQ after max retries
            await receiver.abandonMessage(message);
        }
    },
    processError: async (error) => {
        console.error(`Error in subscription: ${error}`);

        // Alert operations team
        await alertService.notify({
            severity: 'high',
            message: 'Claims Service event subscription error',
            details: { error: error.message }
        });
    }
});
```

**Step 1.4: Configure Monitoring**

