### Code Templates

**Event Publishing with Outbox**:
```csharp
// Begin transaction
using var transaction = await _db.BeginTransactionAsync();

// Insert business data
await _db.Members.InsertAsync(member);

// Insert event to outbox (same transaction)
await _db.Outbox.InsertAsync(new OutboxEvent {
    EventType = "member.enrolled",
    Payload = JsonSerializer.Serialize(memberData)
});

// Commit (atomically persists both)
await transaction.CommitAsync();
```

**Idempotent Event Handler**:
```javascript
// Check if message already processed
const processed = await processedMessages.exists(messageId);
if (processed) {
    await message.complete(); // Acknowledge without reprocessing
    return;
}

// Process message
await handleEvent(message);

// Record as processed (24-hour TTL)
await processedMessages.setEx(messageId, 86400, 'processed');
await message.complete();
```

**Saga Compensation**:
```csharp
try {
    await Step1(); await Step2(); await Step3();
} catch (Exception) {
    // Compensate in reverse order
    await CompensateStep3();
    await CompensateStep2();
    await CompensateStep1();
}
```
